{{Codex|Octavia's pistol hammers foes with single shots or a rapid volley of bullets. When wielded by Octavia, alt-fire Headshot Kills increase Reload Speed.}}
The '''Pandero''' is {{WF|Octavia}}'s signature Pistol, firing semi-automatic shots with sheer power complemented by its high [[Critical Chance]] and [[Critical Multiplier|Multiplier]]. The [[Alternate Fire]] bursts out all remaining rounds in the Magazine as a single full-automatic burst, but disables Aiming, has high recoil, and is wide spread to hinder its range. When wielded by {{WF|Octavia}} or {{WF|Octavia Prime}}, the Pandero will reload faster after a [[Enemy Body Parts|headshot]] Alternative Fire kill.

==Characteristics==
*This weapon deals primarily {{D|Slash}} damage.
*[[Alternate Fire]] shoots all remaining bullets in the magazine in a quick burst.
**Benefits from magazine increasing mods to further increase the burst's Damage.
**Prevents [[Zoom]].
***This prevents the buffs from {{M|Hydraulic Crosshairs}} and {{M|Sharpened Bullets}} from affecting this attack as a result.
**Has high Recoil and wide spread, making it inaccurate beyond short range.

{{Advantages|
*High ammo efficiency.
}}

{{Disadvantages|
*Primary fire has noticeable recoil.
}}

{{WeaponComparison|Pandero Prime}}

==Acquisition==
The Pandero's blueprint can be purchased from the [[Market]].

{{BuildAutomatic|type=Weapon}}
This weapon can be sold for ‍'''5,000'''.

==Notes==
*As a [[Signature Weapon]], Pandero gains a bonus effect when wielded by {{WF|Octavia}} or {{WF|Octavia Prime}}, where [[Enemy Body Parts|headshot]] kills with the [[Alternate Fire]] increases [[Reload Speed]] by '''20%'''.
**No weak spots other than actual heads will trigger this effect.
***Headshots on invulnerable enemies will still grant this effect, but '''not''' with invulnerable bosses.
*The Alternate Fire of the Pandero will eject ''all'' of the remaining Ammunition in the Magazine in a single burst.
**The base [[Fire Rate]] of the Alternative Fire is '''10''' rounds per second
**Increasing the Magazine Size of the Weapon such as with {{M|Slip Magazine}} and using Recoil reduction Mods like {{M|Steady Hands}} can help to make its Damage output more consistent and reliable.
**If buffed with unlimited Ammo such as from the [[Void Fissure#Reactant Buff|Reactant Buff]], the Weapon will only fire its current magazine at a time, with small delays between each trigger pull.
**Alternative Fire be canceled using Quick Melee.
**Aiming will be disabled for the duration of the burst, and so the Alternate Fire cannot benefit from [[Acolyte Mods]].

==Trivia==
*''[[wiktionary:pandero#Spanish|Pandero]]'' is the Spanish word for ''[[wikipedia:Tambourine|Tambourine]]'', a hand-held percussion instrument.
*The Pandero's last four shots sound slightly different, to indicate low Ammunition.
*The Pandero is actually an 8 shot, [[wikipedia:Trigger_(firearms)#Traditional_double-action|double action]] revolver, as indicated in the Reload animation and the rapid manual cocking animation of the the hammer during Alternate Fire.
**The cylinder is very far forward, resulting in an extremely short barrel.

